prompt:
A lesson was written after an engineering incident was fixed:

{g}

Write the incident report the engineer would have written when the failure was first seen, BEFORE anyone knew the cause. Describe only what was observed: which job, command, page or tool, and what went wrong or what error appeared. Do not state the cause, the fix, or the lesson. Avoid the lesson's own wording. One or two sentences, plain text only.
